<title>UK: TABLE - Allied Colloids yr profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Allied Colloids yr profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.76		   vs 5.57</p>
<p> Final dividend (pence) 2.51		   vs 2.28</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.15		   vs 2.86</p>
<p> Pretax		     54.6		   vs 42.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   437.7		  vs 393.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 52.0 and 54.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Allied Colloids Group Plc.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
